ExportingDriversDism=Saving the drivers with DISM...
ExportRetryDism=pnputil couldn't save them all: retrying with DISM, Windows' other tool for exporting drivers (dism /online /export-driver), into the "dism" subfolder.
DriversSavedDism=saved with DISM to %1 (pnputil: %2)
ExportFailedBoth=couldn't be saved: pnputil failed (%1) and so did DISM (%2)
ExportHint=Check that the backup disk is still plugged in, has space (%1 left) and isn't blocked by the antivirus; then save the backup again. The details of both tools are in the drivers task.
BackupIncompleteTitle=The backup isn't complete: don't format yet
BackupIncompleteText=This failed or wasn't done:
BackupIncompleteAction=That's why I'm not offering to restart into the installation USB. Check the log (it's already open), fix what it says and save the backup again.
